      "side": 1,
      "message": "So which hooks are being run from the shell with apshutdown()?\nAFAIK, there should be none, since apshutdown() calls\nap_power_force_shutdown() which calls board_ap_power_force_shutdown(), but no event hooks are being sent.\n\nHowever, I can see that apreset() calls ap_power_reset(), which definitely does call a hook.",
